ning turns your Meta Quest into a corporate VR training station for workplace safety and soft skills.\n\nSign in by entering the **6-digit pairing code** from your operator's dashboard at https://vrsim.training/ \u2014 no cables, no complex setup. Your instructor launches scenarios on your headset and guides the session live, seeing what you see in real time.\n\n**What you can train**\n- Fire response, first aid, and warehouse & office safety\n- AI voice role-play \u2014 talk to interactive AI characters to practice decisions and conversations in a safe environment\n\nEvery session is automatically scored and reviewed by AI, so trainers get measurable results \u2014 not just a checkbox.\n\n**Requirements:** Meta Quest 3 or Quest 3S, Wi-Fi, and an operator account at https://vrsim.training/. Built for teams in manufacturing, logistics, energy, and any organization where safety is critical.", "short_description": "Launch immersive VR safety-training simulators on your Quest, run live by your operator from the VRSim web dashboard. Pair with a 6-digit code, train, get an automatic AI review."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vrsim.training/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Singularity Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vrsim.training/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ru"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_int